    "surprises": "Phase 01 implementation added a sixth module option (sshKey) beyond the five named in the plan, to thread the cluster SSH key from steampipe.toml into the systemd service. Beneficial addition \u2014 without it the service inherits no key path. flake.nix grew two nixosSystem evals (enabled + disabled) and a warm-timer-eval check; the latter forces both fixpoints and reads back serviceConfig.User and timerConfig.OnCalendar, which is stronger than the plan asked for."
